@baseUrl = http://localhost/Proyecto-de-Sistemas2026/api/public
@token = pega_aqui_el_token

### Consulta de proveedores
GET {{baseUrl}}/proveedores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Adicionar proveedor
POST {{baseUrl}}/proveedores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nit_rut": "NIT-900111333",
  "razon_social": "Distribuidora Central S.A.",
  "contacto_nombre": "Maria Perez",
  "direccion": "Av. Central 123",
  "telefono": "70000000",
  "email": "ventas@distribuidoracentral.com"
}

### Actualizar proveedor (cambiar el id por uno existente)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/proveedores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nit_rut": "NIT-900111333",
  "razon_social": "Distribuidora Central S.A.",
  "contacto_nombre": "Maria Perez",
  "direccion": "Av. Central 123",
  "telefono": "70000000",
  "email": "ventas@distribuidoracentral.com"
}

### Eliminar proveedor (cambiar el id por uno existente y sin movimientos asociados)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/proveedores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
